Portable client payload — files pre-copied from 92SAD7q5 into this payload\ folder.

Required files (client32.ini comes from the parent Client-Portable folder, not here):

  Service.exe
  NSM.LIC
  msvcr100.dll
  remcmdstub.exe
  HTCTL32.DLL
  PCICL32.DLL
  PCICHEK.DLL
  pcicapi.dll
  TCCTL32.DLL
  AudioCapture.dll
  nskbfltr.inf

Optional (if present in your bundle):

  nsm_vpro.ini

After copying, run deploy-to-target.cmd on the target PC as Administrator.

Optional — for INI checksum fix after editing client32.ini:

  Copy cksini.exe from a Gateway or Control install into Client-Portable\ before deploy.
  Deploy runs cksini.exe client32.ini, then Service.exe.
